		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A stat-boosting elixir.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Gain +1 to a stat of your choice for 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Lasts 1 minute; you are Stunned for 1 turn after the effect ends.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Temp HP you receive increases by 1.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Elixir B gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Elixir B (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: Temp HP you receive increases by 1.</em></p>",
